<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Empire Tags NYC – Out-of-State Vehicle Registration</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

  <!-- ===========================
       OG / SOCIAL PREVIEW AREA
       Replace content below with your real info & OG images
  ============================ -->
  <!--
    <meta property="og:title" content="Empire Tags NYC – Out-of-State Registration Help">
    <meta property="og:description" content="We help New Yorkers get tags and registration in other states when NY gives you a hard time.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://empiretagsnyc.com/path-to-your-og-image.jpg">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://empiretagsnyc.com/">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  -->

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #050816;
      --bg-card: #0f172a;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --accent-soft: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.14);
      --text-main: #e5e7eb;
      --text-muted: #9ca3af;
      --border-subtle: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
      --error: #f97373;
      --success: #22c55e;
      --ny-yellow: #fbbf24;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text",
        "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1e293b 0, #020617 45%, #000 100%);
      color: var(--text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 16px 40px;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .top-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand-logo-placeholder {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 20px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
    }

    .brand-text-main {
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .brand-text-sub {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .badge-ny {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2),
        rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.03)
      );
    }

    .hero {
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 20px 18px 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3),
          rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8)
        ),
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35), transparent);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.45);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 520px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .hero-kicker {
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: #cbd5f5;
      opacity: 0.8;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 28px);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hero-highlight {
      color: var(--ny-yellow);
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      opacity: 0.9;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .hero-steps {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .hero-pill {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .ny-skyline {
      position: absolute;
      right: -40px;
      bottom: -8px;
      width: 260px;
      height: 120px;
      opacity: 0.22;
      background:
        linear-gradient(to top, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7), transparent 55%),
        repeating-linear-gradient(
          to right,
          rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5) 0,
          rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5) 1px,
          transparent 1px,
          transparent 8px
        );
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, transparent 0, black 30%, black 100%);
      border-radius: 40px;
      transform: skewX(-8deg);
    }

    .ny-skyline::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 5% 12%;
      border-radius: 48px;
      border-bottom: 12px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.7);
      box-shadow: 0 0 36px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.95);
    }

    .hero-og-placeholder {
      position: absolute;
      right: 12px;
      top: 12px;
      width: 150px;
      height: 80px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.7);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.72);
      font-size: 10px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 8px;
      color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);
    }

    main {
      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.1fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding: 18px 18px 16px;
      box-shadow:
        0 18px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7),
        0 0 0 1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
    }

    .card-title-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .card-subtitle {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .badge-step {
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      color: #bfdbfe;
      border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    form {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .field-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    label span.required {
      color: var(--error);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .field-hint {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    input[type="text"],
    input[type="tel"],
    input[type="email"],
    input[type="number"],
    select,
    textarea {
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.7);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 9px 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      outline: none;
      width: 100%;
      transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
    }

    input::placeholder,
    textarea::placeholder {
      color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.8);
    }

    input:focus,
    select:focus,
    textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 1);
    }

    textarea {
      min-height: 80px;
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .file-input-wrapper {
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.9);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      padding: 10px 10px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .file-input-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .file-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
    }

    .file-title {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .file-hint {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .file-input {
      font-size: 11px;
      max-width: 220px;
    }

    .small-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .small-row > .field-group {
      flex: 1 1 140px;
    }

    .submit-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      padding: 9px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #1d4ed8);
      color: #e5e7eb;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.45);
      transition: transform 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.1s ease, filter 0.1s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.04);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.6);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-primary:active {
      transform: translateY(0);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5);
    }

    .submit-note {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .status-message {
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      min-height: 16px;
    }

    .status-success {
      color: var(--success);
    }

    .status-error {
      color: var(--error);
    }

    /* SIDEBAR / PAYMENT / GOOGLE SHEETS CARD */
    .side-card-section {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .stripe-card {
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.85);
      background: radial-gradient(
          circle at top right,
          rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.45),
          transparent 60%
        ),
        #020617;
      padding: 14px 14px 12px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .stripe-chip {
      position: absolute;
      top: 10px;
      right: 12px;
      width: 38px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.8);
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        rgba(229, 231, 235, 0.9),
        rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.8)
      );
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .stripe-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .stripe-text {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .stripe-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96);
      border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.8);
      color: #bfdbfe;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .stripe-link span {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* GOOGLE SHEETS INTEGRATION INFO */
    .integration-card {
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.7);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.82);
      padding: 12px 12px 10px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .integration-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #e5e7eb;
    }

    code {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas,
        "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 3px 5px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.8);
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.9);
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .footer-logo-slot {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .footer-logo-placeholder {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .footer-text {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .layout {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
      .hero {
        padding: 18px 12px 14px;
      }
      .hero-og-placeholder {
        display: none; /* Less clutter on mobile */
      }
      .ny-skyline {
        opacity: 0.16;
        right: -60px;
        width: 230px;
      }
      .page {
        padding-inline: 14px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="top-bar">
        <div class="brand">
          <div class="brand-logo-placeholder">
            <!-- Top-left logo slot (e.g., small icon/logo) -->
            <span>🚗</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="brand-text-main">Empire Tags NYC</div>
            <div class="brand-text-sub">Out-of-state registration service</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="badge-ny">
          <span>🗽</span> Serving New York drivers
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="hero-kicker">Vehicle registration support</div>
          <h1 class="hero-title">
            Get your <span class="hero-highlight">out-of-state tag & registration</span>
            when New York gives you a hard time.
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">
            Fill out this secure form so we can process your tag and registration in a
            different state. Our team will review your details and contact you shortly.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-steps">
            <div class="hero-pill">① Submit vehicle & owner details</div>
            <div class="hero-pill">② Upload title & ID photos</div>
            <div class="hero-pill">③ Complete payment</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- OG / HERO IMAGE PLACEHOLDER BLOCK
             Replace this with an actual hero image or banner if you want -->
        <div class="hero-og-placeholder">
          OG / Hero image area
          <br />NYC + car / registration design
        </div>

        <!-- Abstract NY skyline / city plate shape -->
        <div class="ny-skyline"></div>
      </section>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="layout">
        <!-- ===========================
             MAIN FORM
        ============================ -->
        <section class="card">
          <div class="card-title-row">
            <div>
              <div class="card-title">Driver & Vehicle Information</div>
              <div class="card-subtitle">Step 1 – Tell us about you and your vehicle</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge-step">Step 1 of 2</div>
          </div>

          <form id="registration-form">
            <!--
              IMPORTANT (GOOGLE SHEETS):

              This form is designed to be sent via JavaScript (fetch) to a Google Apps Script Web App,
              which will then write the data into a Google Sheet.

              See JavaScript at the bottom of this file (SCRIPT_URL and handleSubmit).
            -->

            <div class="field-group">
              <label for="fullName">
                Full Name <span class="required">*</span>
              </label>
              <input
                id="fullName"
                name="fullName"
                type="text"
                placeholder="Enter your full legal name"
                required
              />
              <div class="field-hint">
                Please provide your full name as it appears on your ID.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="small-row">
              <div class="field-group">
                <label for="phone">
                  Phone Number <span class="required">*</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  id="phone"
                  name="phone"
                  type="tel"
                  placeholder="(XXX) XXX-XXXX"
                  required
                />
                <div class="field-hint">
                  We’ll call or text you if we need clarification.
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="field-group">
                <label for="email">
                  Email <span class="required">*</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  id="email"
                  name="email"
                  type="email"
                  placeholder="you@example.com"
                  required
                />
                <div class="field-hint">Please provide your email address.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label for="vin">
                Vehicle Identification Number (VIN) <span class="required">*</span>
              </label>
              <input
                id="vin"
                name="vin"
                type="text"
                placeholder="17-character VIN"
                required
              />
              <div class="field-hint">
                You can find this on your title, registration, or the dashboard by the windshield.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="small-row">
              <div class="field-group">
                <label for="color">
                  Color of Vehicle <span class="required">*</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  id="color"
                  name="color"
                  type="text"
                  placeholder="e.g. Black, White, Silver"
                  required
                />
              </div>

              <div class="field-group">
                <label for="mileage">
                  Current Mileage <span class="required">*</span>
                </label>
                <input
                  id="mileage"
                  name="mileage"
                  type="number"
                  min="0"
                  step="1"
                  placeholder="e.g. 68,500"
                  required
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label for="duration">
                Duration for Tag <span class="required">*</span>
              </label>
              <select id="duration" name="duration" required>
                <option value="">Select duration</option>
                <option value="1 year">1 year</option>
                <option value="2 years">2 years</option>
              </select>
              <div class="field-hint">
                Choose how long you’d like the tag to be valid.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label>
                Front Picture of Title <span class="required">*</span>
              </label>
              <div class="file-input-wrapper">
                <div class="file-input-inner">
                  <div class="file-text">
                    <span class="file-title">Upload front of title</span>
                    <span class="file-hint">Clear photo or scan (JPG, PNG, PDF).</span>
                  </div>
                  <input
                    class="file-input"
                    id="titleFront"
                    name="titleFront"
                    type="file"
                    accept="image/*,application/pdf"
                    required
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label>
                Back Picture of Title <span class="required">*</span>
              </label>
              <div class="file-input-wrapper">
                <div class="file-input-inner">
                  <div class="file-text">
                    <span class="file-title">Upload back of title</span>
                    <span class="file-hint">Make sure all writing is readable.</span>
                  </div>
                  <input
                    class="file-input"
                    id="titleBack"
                    name="titleBack"
                    type="file"
                    accept="image/*,application/pdf"
                    required
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label>
                Picture of ID <span class="required">*</span>
              </label>
              <div class="file-input-wrapper">
                <div class="file-input-inner">
                  <div class="file-text">
                    <span class="file-title">Upload License / ID / Passport</span>
                    <span class="file-hint">
                      Front photo of your valid government-issued ID.
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <input
                    class="file-input"
                    id="idPicture"
                    name="idPicture"
                    type="file"
                    accept="image/*,application/pdf"
                    required
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="field-group">
              <label for="notes">
                Additional Notes
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="notes"
                name="notes"
                placeholder="Anything else you would like us to know? (Special circumstances, deadlines, previous issues with NY DMV, etc.)"
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="submit-row">
              <button class="btn-primary" type="submit">
                <span>Submit information</span>
                <span>➜</span>
              </button>
              <div class="submit-note">
                By submitting, you confirm the information is accurate to the best of your knowledge.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="form-status" class="status-message"></div>
          </form>
        </section>

        <!-- ===========================
             SIDE INFO: PAYMENT + GOOGLE SHEETS
        ============================ -->
        <aside class="side-card-section">
          <section class="card stripe-card">
            <div class="stripe-chip"></div>
            <div class="stripe-title">Step 2 – Complete Payment</div>
            <p class="stripe-text">
              After submitting your information, please complete your payment so we can
              start processing your out-of-state registration.
            </p>
            <a
              class="stripe-link"
              href="https://buy.stripe.com/cN228W8iz1d33VC28f"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              <span>💳</span>
              <span>Pay securely with Stripe</span>
            </a>
            <p class="stripe-text">
              Be sure the name and vehicle details match what you entered on the form.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="integration-card">
            <div class="integration-title">Google Sheets Integration</div>
            <p>
              This page is prepared to send data to a Google Sheet using a Google Apps Script
              Web App endpoint.
            </p>
            <ol>
              <li>
                Create a Google Sheet with your columns (<code>Timestamp</code>,
                <code>Full Name</code>, <code>Phone</code>, etc.).
              </li>
              <li>
                In the Sheet, go to <b>Extensions → Apps Script</b> and create a script that
                accepts a POST request and writes rows to the sheet.
              </li>
              <li>
                Deploy as a Web App and copy the Web App URL.
              </li>
              <li>
